@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed the C HTTP parser folding the fragment into the query string for an
+origin-form request target with an empty query (e.g. ``/path?#frag``),
+which diverged from the pure-Python parser -- by :user:`GiulioDER`.
